# This file documents the intended Docker build context for this repo.
#
# NOTE: src/e2e/docker.go builds the e2e test image by hand-walking the
# filesystem (filepath.Walk in addDirToTar) rather than using the Docker
# CLI/SDK's dockerignore-aware context builder, so this file is NOT
# automatically applied by that code path. Instead, addDirToTar is scoped
# to walk only src/ (the one directory the Dockerfile's `COPY src/ .`
# instruction needs), which achieves the same effect directly in Go.
#
# This file remains here for:
#   - documentation of what's excluded and why
#   - defense-in-depth / correctness if `docker build` is ever invoked
#     directly (e.g. CLI, CI, or a future build path that does honor
#     .dockerignore) against the repo root
#   - safety if the Dockerfile's COPY scope ever expands beyond src/
.git
bin
docs
.superpowers
.claude
.config
.gitignore
README.md
